{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b5ce80c9ff93b2e1","name":"Forceful Blast","source":{"id":"source:reference-b5ce80c9ff93b2e1","title":"Forceful Blast","revision":20871,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:41:07Z","sha256":"958e24d31157ec894d42f77b6c12ed2e4f1ecb8c28d0fdfdc9def868427ac7bb","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20871","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Forceful%20Blast&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b5ce80c9ff93b2e1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can position your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"}," attacks such that they blast creatures away from the center of the explosion.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +1, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Simple_Weapons)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When you damage a Large or smaller creature with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thermal Detonator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thermal_Detonator","referenceId":"reference:0cb8bf5b3c4e20e2"},", compare the result of your attack roll to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If your result equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", you can move the target 1 square in any direction as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"}," deals damage to multiple eligible creatures, you can use this benefit against all of them. You can't move a target that's being ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"},", and you can't move a target into a solid object or into another creature's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
